Subject: [PATCH] Retain One UI 9 filesystem and property ownership with the API30 vendor

Correct only changed filesystem/property classifications. Preserve the
legacy HIDL/HAL client roles, including vold/keymaster. Assign the old
exported vendor properties to their real owner, and complete the current
hal_health_server BPF domain contract. No allow is added.

